    "detailed_description": "Mr Monkey &amp; Touc is an N64 throwback 3D collectathon. You play as Mr Monkey and his trusty partner Touc as you travel through 6 unique worlds to save colourful characters, and fight various enemies and bosses along the way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2>Being parkour experts, Mr Monkey and Touc will no doubt have <i>&quot;the skills to pay the bills&quot;</i> (developer note: there is no bill paying in the Jungle, as we all know; it's a tax haven). The players movement mechanics are as follows:<br><br><strong>Mr Monkey</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Running/Rolling</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Double Jumping</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tree Climbing</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Coconut Throwing</li></ul><strong>Touc</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gliding</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Breaking Walls</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dropping Rocks</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worlds</h2>Explore 6 unique worlds within the mysterious jungle Mr Monkey &amp; Touc call home. The first world is a forest full of life, with a village on treetop, and a lot of dam beavers!",
    "about_the_game": "Mr Monkey &amp; Touc is an N64 throwback 3D collectathon. You play as Mr Monkey and his trusty partner Touc as you travel through 6 unique worlds to save colourful characters, and fight various enemies and bosses along the way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2>Being parkour experts, Mr Monkey and Touc will no doubt have <i>&quot;the skills to pay the bills&quot;</i> (developer note: there is no bill paying in the Jungle, as we all know; it's a tax haven). The players movement mechanics are as follows:<br><br><strong>Mr Monkey</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Running/Rolling</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Double Jumping</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tree Climbing</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Coconut Throwing</li></ul><strong>Touc</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gliding</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Breaking Walls</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dropping Rocks</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Worlds</h2>Explore 6 unique worlds within the mysterious jungle Mr Monkey &amp; Touc call home. The first world is a forest full of life, with a village on treetop, and a lot of dam beavers!",
    "short_description": "An N64 throwback 3D collectathon. Play as Mr Monkey and his partner Touc to save their friends and the jungle they call home, and takedown the robots who threaten it. Explore 7 unique worlds, meet a colourful cast of characters and GO. BANANAS.",
